@startuml
[*] --> Initial State
Initial State --> Monitoring Zones : System starts monitoring zones
Monitoring Zones --> Checking Zone Armed Status : Movement detected in zone
Checking Zone Armed Status --> Sending Notifications : Zone armed
Checking Zone Armed Status --> Monitoring Zones : Zone not armed
Sending Notifications --> Logging Trigger History : Notifications sent
Logging Trigger History --> Monitoring Zones : Trigger history logged
Monitoring Zones --> [*] : System stops monitoring
@enduml
